{"h":"\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden\">\n\n\n<!-- hero -->\n<div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #BFE5FF\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"customs-poster.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% 50%\" aria-label=\"Bright office overlooking a sunny container port, with shipping documents on the desk\">\n<source src=\"customs.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.96) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.88) 36%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 62%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 76%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 32px 104px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 660px\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 22px\">LICENSED CUSTOMS BROKER · R-7/92 · SINCE 1992</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(52px, 6.4vw, 100px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 24px\">Cleared right <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">the first time.</span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #17436B; margin: 0 0 30px\">We hold our own customs broker licence, so classification, duty, permissions and filing are done by the same people who move your cargo. Problems get solved before the ship sails, not after it lands.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Get a duty estimate →</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"background: #25D366; color: #06331A; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">WhatsApp a broker</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- stats -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: -44px; position: relative; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(11,42,74,0.10); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr))\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{stats}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<div style=\"padding: 26px 28px; border-right: 1px solid #E1EDF7\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; color: #0A6CC2\">{{s.v}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3D5873; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.4\">{{s.l}}</div>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- services -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px 40px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">WHAT WE CLEAR AND SORT OUT</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 40px; max-width: 980px\">Everything between your invoice and out of charge.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{services}}\" as=\"c\" hint-placeholder-count=\"9\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #0A6CC2; letter-spacing: 0.1em\">{{c.k}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1\">{{c.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3D5873\">{{c.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- process -->\n<div style=\"background: #FFF8E6; margin-top: 60px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #B45309; margin-bottom: 14px\">HOW AN IMPORT CLEARS WITH YAM</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 44px\">We start before the ship arrives.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{steps}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%;\">{{s.n}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 19px\">{{s.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4030\">{{s.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- checklist -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 56px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 28px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">DOCUMENT CHECKLIST</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">What we'll need from you.</h2>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Shipment direction\" style=\"display: inline-flex; background: #EEF6FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px; gap: 4px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{dirs}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"2\">\n<button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"{{t.on}}\" onClick=\"{{t.pick}}\" style=\"{{t.style}}\">{{t.label}}</button>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 10px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{docs}}\" as=\"d\" hint-placeholder-count=\"8\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 18px; background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 16px; align-items: start\">\n<span style=\"{{d.dotStyle}}\">✓</span>\n<span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px\">{{d.t}}</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #5E7891; line-height: 1.45\">{{d.b}}</span></span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; margin: 14px 0 0\">Yellow items are always needed. Blue items depend on the product, the scheme and the country of origin. We tell you exactly which apply when you send the invoice.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- problems -->\n<div style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #FFC93C; margin-bottom: 14px\">WHERE SHIPMENTS GET STUCK</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 40px; max-width: 900px\">The problems we catch before they cost you.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{traps}}\" as=\"p\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.15\">{{p.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #DCEEFC\">{{p.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- stations -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 56px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 32px\">\n<h2 style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Where we clear.</h2>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">We file and follow up at these customs stations across India, by sea, air and inland container depot.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{stations}}\" as=\"g\" hint-placeholder-count=\"14\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 20px; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #B45309; font-weight: 500\">{{g.k}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 108%; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1\">{{g.n}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3D5873\">{{g.c}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<div style=\"background: #F2F8FD\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 56px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 32px\">Customs clearance questions</h2>\n<sc-for list=\"{{faqs}}\" as=\"q\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n<details style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 10px\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px\">{{q.q}}<span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">+</span></summary>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 12px 0 0\">{{q.a}}</p>\n</details>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between\">\n<h2 style=\"flex: 1 1 600px; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.8vw, 68px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Send us the invoice. <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">We'll tell you the duty before it ships.</span></h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Get a duty estimate →</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"background: #25D366; color: #06331A; padding: 18px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">WhatsApp the invoice</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n"}